-- (wowhead.com/forever/item=<id>, read 2026-11-28). Items Wowhead Forever shows without a sell price are left alone.
-- 91 of them have Blizzard ItemSparse hotfix rows: the newest row is copied with the price. The other 367 are only in the
-- client's ItemSparse.db2 (build 71037): their rows are written out in full from that file, with the price.
